<p class="lede">I put two resource cards beside each other. Both promise the same destination. One needs a small driving lesson before the keyboard can get there.</p>

<p>The entries are invented for this AI-assisted local experiment. The test compares the two implementations shown here, with page JavaScript enabled and disabled. It makes no claim about a named framework or a production website.</p>

