    <div class="rp-card rp-mouse-only" id="rp-mouse-card" role="link" tabindex="0">
      <h3>Editing practice A</h3>
      <p>A fictional resource with a mouse click handler and no keyboard handler.</p>
    </div>
    <figcaption><b>The implementation under test.</b> It is deliberately limited to the shown mouse handler. A complete scripted implementation could add the missing behavior.</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <figure class="step">
    <article class="rp-card">
      <h3><a id="rp-native-link" href="#rp-destination">Editing practice A</a></h3>
      <p>The same fictional destination, expressed as a link.</p>
      <label class="rp-mark"><input id="rp-example-mark" type="checkbox"> Mark this example</label>
    </article>
